6) LOCAL vs GLOBAL INDEX (INTERVIEW GOLD)
==============================================================================

Local:
✔ simple
✔ fast writes
❌ global query slow

Global:
✔ fast reads
❌ write heavy
❌ consistency issues

Golden line:
"Local indexes scale better for writes, while global indexes scale better for
reads but introduce write amplification and consistency challenges."

==============================================================================


==============================================================================
7) COMBINING PARTITIONING + REPLICATION
==============================================================================

In real systems:

Each shard:
→ replicated

Example:
Shard A:
Leader + followers

So system:
Partitioning + replication together.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY?
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Partitioning = scale
Replication = durability + availability

